cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AcmPilot"
abstract: "Adaptive coding and modulation on a single optical link under feedback delay — declared MODCOD set with measured thresholds, fixed-margin and hysteresis-threshold policies plus a clairvoyant upper bound no causal policy can beat, throughput and outage and mis-selection accounting against round-trip feedback delay; learned channel predictor over the feedback horizon with a confidence output gating aggressive rate choices."
